  "post_content": "<p>Este s&aacute;bado ha abierto sus puertas en la avenida Montendre, 60 de Onda APdance, dirigido por Ana Peris, donde adem&aacute;s de la especialidad que domina, el zumba, se pueden practicar otros bailes y disciplinas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/01/IMG_0295.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>En APdance se imparte yoga, zumba fitness, junior&nbsp;o&nbsp;kids, gap pilates, salsa individual o parejas, baile senior, pilates suelo o implementos, sevillanas y taller de relajaci&oacute;n/meditaci&oacute;n.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inanuguracioanaperisdance/img_0268.jpg\" alt=\"img_0268\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inanuguracioanaperisdance/img_0269.jpg\" alt=\"img_0269\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inanuguracioanaperisdance/img_0274.jpg\" alt=\"img_0274\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inanuguracioanaperisdance/img_0275.jpg\" alt=\"img_0275\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inanuguracioanaperisdance/img_0276.jpg\" alt=\"img_0276\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inanuguracioanaperisdance/img_0277.jpg\" alt=\"img_0277\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inanuguracioanaperisdance/img_0278.jpg\" alt=\"img_0278\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inanuguracioanaperisdance/img_0280.jpg\" alt=\"img_0280\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https:/